t your concentration and attention is getting affected due to stress at work or home. When you are engaged in work, you seem to be an efficient member of the team, however, sometimes you may lose the track and end up thinking about your future a bit too much.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',2),(101,15.00,19.00,'Severe',39,37,'Things at work or home might not be going as per your way. It could be an overwhelming feeling. You might feel uneasy and there could be a constant sense of worry. You might also experience breathlessness, rapid heartbeat, palpitations, sweating, trembling, etc. Your performance might get affected because of the burden of unreasonable worries. Your concentration and attention level could also be getting affected. You might feel on the edge and even small issues could be affecting you deeply. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',3),(102,20.00,42.00,'Extremely Severe',39,37,'You might be feeling extremely uneasy and there could be a tendency to ignore personal and professional responsibilities. Tasks which seemed easy earlier might be getting difficult to complete. Your heartbeat and breath could be abnormal most of the times because of constant worries. Your irritation or agitation to even a trivial stimulus could be magnified. Your ability to think and understand might have gotten affected significantly. You might be having sleepless nights. Due to so many changes, there is a presumption that you might be feeling incapable of continuing work or even taking up meager responsibilities.You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',4),(103,0.00,9.00,'Normal',40,38,'You seem to have an ability to understand and balance your emotions, understand what is causing problems and manage yourself proactively and reactively. It seems that you are an emotionally strong person and do not allow ups and downs of life to impact your mental wellbeing. Your quality to keep personal, social and professional life in harmony seems to be remarkable. Your reaction to something is usually as per the intensity of the situation. You seem to like being around people and a part of a social circle. At work, you seem to be energetic and full of motivation. It seems that you are satisfied with your performance while striving to achieve more. Mood swings might not affect you often and usually, you are in a balanced state of mind','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',1),(104,10.00,13.00,'Mild',40,38,'You seem to be an energetic and easy-going person who might like to be a part of group activities and interacting with new people. It seems that you are able to understand your emotions and thoughts and dissect them to know what is causing what? You are probably capable of managing your work-life balance well. \r\nOf late, you may notice a shift in your energy levels and excitement for things that make you happy. Once in a while, you might not want to be part of social gatherings because you are not excited about it. You might experience mood swings rarely but it might affect your performance on such days. \r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',2),(105,14.00,20.00,'Moderate',40,38,'You seem to be an easy-going person who likes to be a part of group activities and interacting with new people. It seems that you understand your emotions and thoughts and dissect them to know what is causing what. You probably are capable to manage your work-life balance well but sometimes, you might face problems in your personal, professional and social life. At work, you could be performing well and completing tasks but there can be times when you end up making small mistakes. Focusing on things might be getting a little difficult when you are surrounded by a lot of work or thoughts. You probably feel fatigued a little more than often and sometimes there could be some body aches too. You need to be observant of the situation.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',2),(106,21.00,27.00,'Severe',40,38,'You might be unable to find happiness in the things that excited you in past. Social gatherings may not be as exciting and you might be feeling distant from your friends and family. There could be lack in energy and you might feel like resting or sleeping throughout the day. Your job might not interest you anymore. There could be increased sensitivity towards trivial matters.  Your loved ones might have talked to you about this shift in your behavior. Feeling of agitation and irritation is understandable in such a situation. You might have a perception of having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t actually present.  You need to take the situation seriously and look out for some help.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',3),(107,28.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',40,38,'You might be experiencing sadness and distress mostly throughout the day. Socializing might be a little difficult these days. Things that made you happy might be unable to give you a sense of satisfaction or contentment. You might be having troubles in continuing your routine work and personal activities. You might not be waking up fresh and excited to start the new day. There could be feelings of tiredness, lethargy, sleeplessness, etc. Sometimes, you might even experience body aches. Things might not be looking great at your workplace as well. You might not be interested in your work, hence, increasing numbers of absent days. Your difficult feelings and behaviour might be concerning to your friends or family. Feelings of agitation and irritation are natural in such a situation. You could perceive having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t present.You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 10:20:34','2021-06-19 10:20:34',4),(108,0.00,0.00,'Present',42,40,'<p>You seem like an epitome of a modern woman who takes informed and independent decisions about her finances. It appears that you have complete control of your money. You might take advice from people but never let anyone overpower your voice. You seem to have set boundaries in your family regarding your financial matters. It reflects that you are confident and aware of the consequences of your decisions.</p>','straight',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:28:54','2021-06-19 18:28:54',1),(109,1.00,5.00,'Absent',42,40,'<p>Taking decisions regarding financial matters can be overwhelming. You might get under the pressure and give control to other people regarding your finances. Though you are the earning person, your control over your money is limited. Due to this, you might feel uneasy, frustrated and sometimes may have issues in your relationships. You may like to take control back of your financial independence. For that, you need to be confident and sometimes headstrong. You might want to set boundaries with other people in your family. The process can be emotionally draining. You can take the help of various psychological techniques or tools for guidance to take this forward.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:31:33','2021-06-30 17:48:47',4),(110,0.00,14.00,'Normal',43,41,'You seem to be able to handle stressful situations aptly, without getting anxious. You appear to be confident and have a positive attitude in your day to day life. Challenges at home or work seem to not affect you adversely. You seem to have a healthy sleep schedule and can sleep peacefully without any tension. Even if you face difficult or stressful situations, it appears that you deal with them calmly instead of panicking. You seem to not dwell in arguments and try to focus on the solution rather than thinking about the problem. You seem to have a good 