d hardworking. It appears that you are an ambitious person who tries to be better than people around themself.\r\nYou seem to give your best so that your colleagues and managers appreciate you. Sometimes, you might not be able to take criticism healthily. \r\nYou seem to focus on your work rather than investing time in group activities or discussions. Hence, some people might perceive you are unsocial. At your home, you might not like to engage in small talk. It might be affecting your interpersonal relationships. Your family members might want to talk to you. However, you might be unable to reciprocate with the same intensity of emotions. \r\nYou seem to be a responsible person who seeks security in all the spheres of life. If you learn to remain somewhat relaxed in many spheres of life then your qualities can take you to places.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:55','2021-06-19 18:38:55',NULL),(114,0.00,0.00,'',46,44,'You are a person who feels responsible and keeps secret ambitions in life. Hard work for things of your liking comes to you easy. In areas of your choice, you can go to any level of micro management. Perfectionism seems to be one of your greatest virtues. You tend to spend extra time perfecting even the smallest details. It appears that your skills match your job role and you try to give your best. Sometimes, you might feel that you are not performing up to the mark becuase you fall short of own ambitions. You might even doubt the quality of your work. Everything comes secondary to your need of being perfect. It might affect your interpersonal relationships. \r\n\r\nYou have fairly good leadership skills and competetive behavior may also reflect in your personality. These traits can keep you ahead of others in your field.\r\n\r\nYou seem to have high standards in your area of expertise which might not be possible for everyone to achieve in your team. Hence, you might come across as someone very particular and may not come up as a team player. Others may get away from you for this want of perfection.\r\nYou seem to have high standards which might not be possible for everyone to achieve in your team. Hence, you might across as someone very particular. Other employees might find it hard to match up to your expectations','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:55','2021-06-19 18:38:55',NULL),(115,0.00,0.00,'',47,45,'You might be an emotional and expressive person due to which some people might think that you could be seeking attention. You are confident of self and ability to create vision for others. Your ability to focus on big picture can help you in takeing others along.Your ability to address large groups and get them to align around bigger purpose may keep you ahead of others.\r\nYou seem to be receptive of other\'s opinions and thoughts. Sometimes, you might change your decision at the last moment as accomodating many ideas may defer things. Hence, people might think you are indecisive. It might lead to problems in your personal, marital and occupational setup.\r\nYou seem to be confident in your skin and can pull off difficult situations. If someone compliments on your physical appearance, you seem to like it. Your image concious behavior can sometimes keep you away from opportunities.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:55','2021-06-19 18:38:55',NULL),(116,0.00,0.00,'',48,46,'You may be very creative and intense in your approach. You seem to be particular and selective about your needs and wants, which might cause confusion and dilemma at times. This also puts delay in decisions and lingering off of key issues. You seem to be exploring your identity and sexuality as you might be unsure about it. Your relationships seem to be intense and you may get deep into them; however, your partners might have not been able to fulfil your emotional needs. Due to unsuccessful relationships, you might feel hollow or disconnect from people around you. Some problematic behaviours might be recurring due to which you might face adjustment problems in your relationships. Try to be sure and more informed about your decisions which may help you against all these odds.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:55','2021-06-19 18:38:55',NULL),(117,0.00,0.00,'',49,47,'You have the ability to take those steps in life which others can\'t but be aware to not be rash in your journey. People may see you as courageous and path breaker but be aware they may take benefit of this ability of yours. Exercising caution in your decisions and actions can make you stand out in life. To act swiftly and seize the opportunities is your style and may keep you ahead in many ways. On the other hand, you seem to be a sensitive person and might easily be affected by criticism. You might be unable to handle stressful situations and keep calm. It leads to increased vulnerability and somtimes there could be thoughts of self-harm or may be others. You might be having troubles in your relationships due to high intensity of emotions and can incur personal losses. Advised to practice calmness and mindfulness.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',NULL),(118,0.00,0.00,'',50,48,'You seem to have a higher purpose in life and open to take risks for achieving it. You are the one who can step out of comfort zone for any cause and lead by example. Your hard work and drive to get there is inspiring for others and can make some most difficult projects to see light of the day. You can take decisions and stand by them for good. This open and revolutionary behavior may not conform to the rules of society sometimes and may make things difficult. You seem to be devoted to achieving your higher goals hence, your closed ones might feel that you are ignoring their emotional needs and responsibilities, so be bit careful about it.\r\n\r\nYou seem to have leadership qualities that makes you drive with single minded focus and due to the same sometimes, it might get difficult for you to accept criticism. You might be a little uncomfortable while dealing with unfavourable situations. Taking care of these tendencies may help, in taking people along with you.\r\n\r\nYou seem to believe that you are on the right path, so decision making comes natural to you. Even if you have to do something that is out of your comfort zone, you might do it without feeling guilty and in most passionate way.\r\n\r\nSince you seem to be so engrossed in your cause, you might feel disconnected from others. You might think that people are unable to understand your purpose. It might affect your interpersonal relationships and lead to rough situations. Be aware of these tendencies.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',NULL),(119,0.00,14.00,'Normal',51,49,'You seem to nurture confidence and peace in your day to day life. Challenges in personal and occupational life seem to motivate you to achieve your goals. You seem to be committed to a higher purpose in life, which helps you in becoming a better person each day. You seem to be able to handle difficult situations in life with vigour and a tranquil mind.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(120,15.00,24.00,'Has State Anxiety',51,49,'However, sometimes, unpleasant situations at work or home might get overwhelming. It might affect your mood, sleep pattern, attention and concentration. These feelings are usually not permanent and might appear only when you face a difficult situation. The discomfort might subside when the current challenge is alleviated. Besides, you seem to be a calm and composed person. It appears that you stay relaxed in day to day life and have the ability to handle difficult emotions.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',NULL),(121,281.00,300.00,'Extremely Happy',52,50,'You appear to be a happy and positive person. You seem to be an inspiration to others. It appears that you live in the present instead of dwelling in the past or future. You seem to have faith in your abilities and do not spend time worrying if you are good enough or not. Doubts and apprehensions do not seem to weigh you down. It appears that you also like to spend quality time with your friends and family. You seem to be adaptable and not worry much about life’s unpredictability. Optimism appears to be one of your greatest virtues. You tend to look at the positives instead of searching for faults.\r\n','straight',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(122,251.00,280.00,'Happy',52,50,'You seem to be a happy soul. It appears that you spread happiness and others like to be around you. You seem to be an optimistic person who focuses on the positive aspects of life. Apprehensions and doubts do not seem to affect you. You appear to be living in the present instead of dwelling in past or future.\r\n','straight',7,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(123,200.00,250.00,'Moderately Happy',52,50,'You seem to be a happy person but sometimes you might get affected by a few things in your environment. For instance, if someone criticizes you regarding your work, you might feel low for some time. You tend to stand right up instead of lamenting over something that didn’t go your way. It seems that you try to keep your spirits up by making changes in your lifestyle.\r\n','straight',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(124,0.00,199.00,'Unhappy',52,50,'Your happiness might be getting affected by your environment. It seems that you give priority to others first instead of yourself. You might be trying to please people around you so that they have a good perception of you. That might need you to go an extra mile and sometimes out of your comfort zone. You might get discouraged if you hear a negative perception of yourself. There is a tendency to dwell in past or future instead of living in the moment. You might also get affected by apprehensions and self-doubt.\r\n','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',4),(125,0.00,14.00,'Normal',53,51,'Stress affects us all differently, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You tend to stay excited about life in general and have a positive attitude towards various challenges. Your closed ones seem be proud of you since you might understand your responsibilities and try to stand by your values. It appears that you are confident about your skills and capability, hence, you would be performing well at your workplace. It seems that you do not tend to dwell in arguments and quarrels and try to handle difficult situations calmly. You seem to be taking work pressure lightly. If there is loads of work and tight deadlines, it appears that you plan it well and then execute to finish work on time. You seem to maintain balance in your personal and professional life. Your physiological state appears to be in a good shape as well. \r\n','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(126,15.00,18.00,'Mild',53,51,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You appear be an active person who manages house chores and daily work efficiently. Your sleep quality seems to be satisfactory. You seem to be waking up fresh most of the days. Of late, you might get a headache due to stress at home or work. You seem to be diligent, thorough and extremely attentive to the details, hence, your ability to make quick decisions might be affected. You seem to perform very well in a team and do not get apprehensive about your performance.Seldom,stress might get to you and you might end up feeling drained.\r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(127,19.00,25.00,'Moderate',53,51,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives. You seem to be an optimistic person in general, who strives towards his/her goals and is hopeful about the future. You seem to perform well at work and might need to stick to a strict schedule. Being competitive could be one of your virtues as it seems to help you in achieving more. This behavior is slowly catching up with you.\r\nSometimes you might get overwhelmed with work and try to do everything at once. From time to time you might also suffer from sleepless nights, which might lead to a headache. Your friends or one of your family members might have casually asked you to take it lightly and relax. Since it seems that you have high expectations from yourself, you can feel discouraged if you are unable to achieve your goals. Sometimes, you might even take a lot of pressure on yourself and end up losing your appetite. You need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(128,26.00,33.00,'Severe',53,51,'You must be wondering why you are feeling worn out constantly. Your efficiency to perform tasks at work and daily chores might have also reduced significantly. You might be getting agitated and frustrated because of this. One of your friends or a family member must have shown concern towards your behaviour. It is a possibility that because of this constant sense of worry you are unable to sleep most of the nights in a week. There could be a drop in your appetite too. You might be suffering from a terrible headache which does not seem to go away. All of this, collectively, could have affected your ability to understand and perform tasks. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',3),(129,34.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',53,51,'You could be having a hard time paying heed to the responsibilities at work and home. Your sleeping and eating pattern might have been significantly affected. There is a possibility that you aren’t able to attend your work.Your colleagues and head of the team might be noticing change in your performance and may have shared with you the same which could be hampering your confidence. You might be feeling demotivated to do even the things you are passionate about. Your close friends or a family member might have also mentioned about your growing tendency of indecisiveness and lack in patience. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',4),(130,0.00,11.00,'Normal',54,52,'You use the Internet adequately and do not allow it to hamper your daily life. You might be comfortable even when you don’t access your phone or social media regularly. The chances are that you use the Internet for knowledge and enhancing your performance. Even if your smartphone doesn’t have an internet connection, you seem to not get affected by it.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(131,12.00,17.00,'Mild',54,52,'<p>You seem to be aware of the pros and cons of using the internet. It appears that you usually utilize the internet for getting information. You seem to spend some time on social media as well. Of late, you might be using the internet more than usual. You might tend to indulge without realizing the limitations of your screen time. However, it seems that you can control your usage once you know that it’s affecting your day to day life and work performance.</p>','inverse',7,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-25 01:16:25',5),(132,18.00,28.00,'Moderate',54,52,'You seem to be aware of the pros and cons of using the internet but loosing control on self, slowly. You might have also noticed that your internet consumption is increasing gradually. It seems that you must take some measures to restrict your usage. You appear to be quite active on social media. It might be your escape from your real life. It seems that you enjoy engaging and talking to people online.\r\nSometimes you might use the internet more than usual. There could have been an instance where one of your family members poked you regarding your internet indulgence. It might have irritated you. From time to time, you want to spend extra time on the internet. It can lead you to lose interest in your job & family. It might also affect your work performance.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(133,29.00,35.00,'Severe',54,52,'In an era where the internet is so easily accessible, it is easy to go with the flow. You might be using the internet more than usual and it might have started affecting your personal and professional life. You might not be interested in your education, career or job. It might be getting difficult for you to assess the consequences of overconsumption of the internet. Social media might be your escape from the real world. You might genuinely like engaging in online conversations instead of talking to people in real life. There could have been an instance where one of your family members poked you regarding your indulgence in social media and that might have irritated you. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',4),(134,36.00,40.00,'Very High',55,53,'Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Very high self-esteem indicates that you are confident about your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviours.\r\n\r\nYou seem to have an adequate level of self-worth and a positive approach towards yourself. Strong principles and values seem to be your guiding force. Some of these values could be honest, trust, integrity, etc. You seem to have an inner drive to succeed. You tend to focus on your strengths and seem to be confident about your skills.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(135,31.00,35.00,'High',55,53,'<p>Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Your high self-esteem indicates that you seem to see yourself in a positive light. You appear to be confident in your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviour. You seem to be adaptable and open to new challenges and changes. It is your self-worth and confidence that helps you to eradicate any apprehensions or adversities.</p>','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-25 01:16:42',5),(136,26.00,30.00,'Average',55,53,'You seem to be a confident person who tries to have a positive outlook on life but sometimes self doubt is emerging. There could be a sense of self-worth and self-appreciation. You seem to be guided by a set of strong principles and values. Your perception of yourself appears to be clear and positive. It seems to help you sail through the tough times. In recent times, you might be getting anxious and doubtful in a stressful situation. However, it does not seem to affect your self-esteem but you need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(137,16.00,25.00,'Low',55,53,'Things might not be looking great in the office or at home due to possible lack of in your confidence level and feeling inferior to others. Regardless of the skills or talent you carry, you might doubt yourself and fear the judgment of others. There could be a lot of confusion and it might seem like you are experiencing some sort of a crisis. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',3),(138,10.00,15.00,'Very Low',55,53,'A very low self-esteem indicates that you might be having some sort of trouble in establishing your identity. This might lead to inferiority complex and negative self-worth and self-evaluations. You might be finding it tough to strive for the best. You can feel that you are not enough. This might cause some trouble in your personal and professional life. Your friends or someone from your family might have mentioned that you are too rigid and that makes it difficult to deal with you. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',4),(139,1.00,2.99,'Low Resilience',56,54,'You seem to be a positive and efficient person but it appears that off late you are finding it difficult to bounce back after a crisis. \r\nSometimes you might find it very hard to deal with a significant setback. You might overthink about various situations and their adverse outcomes. It might affect the way you think and plan for the future. Your potential to bounce back might not be looking adequate. There is a possibility of getting depressive thoughts and mood swings. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',4),(140,3.00,4.30,'Normal Resilience',56,54,'You seem to be a realist and can look at things as they are in life. It appears that you can deal with adversities practically. You seem to not be in denial for long and start thinking of the next step required to get out of the setback. You seem to be able to deal with life’s adverse situations adequately.','straight',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(141,4.31,5.00,'High Resilience',56,54,'Resilience is the capacity to recover from difficult events. You seem to have an ability to with stand adversity and bounce back despite life’s downturns. Restarting after a setback seems to be not so difficult for you, however, it might be emotionally draining. Your coping mechanism seems to be helping you to start, think or plan again. ','straight',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(142,6.00,7.00,'Normal',57,55,'Balancing personal and professional life can be tough at times but it seems that you are able to deal with it adequately. Sometimes you can feel a little overwhelmed, it’s natural. However, it appears that you do not  get discouraged to pursue your goals. Your skill-set seems to be as per the job requirement. Hence, you appear to enjoy working without getting exhausted. Your work-life balance seems to be satisfactory and you are able to enjoy time with friends & family and engaging in group activities. The pressure at work seems to not affect you adversely. It appears to work as a catalyst for enhancing your performance. It seems that you are able to organize the work at office efficiently and complete the tasks in the given time. \r\n','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',1),(143,8.00,13.00,'Mild',57,55,'It seems that you are performing well at work. Your skills and aptitude appear to be as per the requirement of the job. The pressure at work seems to motivate you to be more efficient. You seem to set high standards for yourself. Of late, you might feel discouraged if you are unable to stand on your expectations. You tend to manage your work-life balance well. You seem to be satisfied with your personal life as well.\r\n\r\nJob burnout is a kind of work-related stress. It might affect you once in a blue moon, but mostly, you seem to be able to handle it with optimism.\r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(144,14.00,20.00,'Moderate',57,55,'Balancing personal and professional life can be tough at times and though it seems that you are efficient and a great team player in your office but slowly the balance is tilting. Your experience, skills and aptitude seems to suit the job role. It appears that you set high standards for yourself, which helps you to be productive but, you might feel exhausted and disheartened if you are unable to achieve your goals. Mostly, you seem to be an optimistic person but occasionally you might get under pressure. It might cause some stress which can lead to sleep disturbance.\r\n \r\nJob burnout is distress related to work. Usually, you can manage it appropriately but sometimes it is getting over you. On those days, you might lack the motivation to start the work and the level of concentration and attention might also dip. You need to be observant about it.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',2),(145,21.00,24.00,'Severe',57,55,'Professional life is getting too demanding for you, at times. It is also possible that you might be giving it all to please your colleagues and managers. You might be working harder than needed because of the high workload or to fulfill expectations set against you. It might be leading to an imbalance in your personal and professional life. You might have very little or no time for yourself and this may cause exhaustion soon. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',3),(146,25.00,30.00,'Extremely Severe',57,55,'Professional life is getting too demanding for you. It is also possible that you are giving it your all to please the colleagues and managers. You might be working overtime because of the high workload or to fulfill high expectations set against you. It might lead to an imbalance in your personal and professional life. This can cause exhaustion as you might be having very little or no time for yourself. It is also possible that it is leading to poor performance and creating a spiral. It might also affect your emotional and mental health. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-06-19 18:38:56','2021-06-19 18:38:56',4),(147,0.00,7.00,'Normal',58,56,'<p>You appear to be a positive person who is not much affected by negative thoughts and apprehensions. The level of your concentration and attention seems to be good and hence, the tendency to make small mistakes turns out to be low. It seems that you are peaceful and balanced most of the time and take decisions after thinking through. Your sleep quality is probably good an