 it well. You tend to stay excited about life in general and have a positive attitude towards various challenges. Your closed ones seem be proud of you since you might understand your responsibilities and try to stand by your values. It appears that you are confident about your skills and capability, hence, you would be performing well at your workplace. It seems that you do not tend to dwell in arguments and quarrels and try to handle difficult situations calmly. You seem to be taking work pressure lightly. If there is loads of work and tight deadlines, it appears that you plan it well and then execute to finish work on time. You seem to maintain balance in your personal and professional life. Your physiological state appears to be in a good shape as well. \r\n','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:06','2021-07-02 08:35:06',1),(261,15.00,18.00,'Mild',104,102,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You appear be an active person who manages house chores and daily work efficiently. Your sleep quality seems to be satisfactory. You seem to be waking up fresh most of the days. Of late, you might get a headache due to stress at home or work. You seem to be diligent, thorough and extremely attentive to the details, hence, your ability to make quick decisions might be affected. You seem to perform very well in a team and do not get apprehensive about your performance.Seldom,stress might get to you and you might end up feeling drained.\r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:06','2021-07-02 08:35:06',2),(262,19.00,25.00,'Moderate',104,102,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives. You seem to be an optimistic person in general, who strives towards his/her goals and is hopeful about the future. You seem to perform well at work and might need to stick to a strict schedule. Being competitive could be one of your virtues as it seems to help you in achieving more. This behavior is slowly catching up with you.\r\nSometimes you might get overwhelmed with work and try to do everything at once. From time to time you might also suffer from sleepless nights, which might lead to a headache. Your friends or one of your family members might have casually asked you to take it lightly and relax. Since it seems that you have high expectations from yourself, you can feel discouraged if you are unable to achieve your goals. Sometimes, you might even take a lot of pressure on yourself and end up losing your appetite. You need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:06','2021-07-02 08:35:06',2),(263,26.00,33.00,'Severe',104,102,'You must be wondering why you are feeling worn out constantly. Your efficiency to perform tasks at work and daily chores might have also reduced significantly. You might be getting agitated and frustrated because of this. One of your friends or a family member must have shown concern towards your behaviour. It is a possibility that because of this constant sense of worry you are unable to sleep most of the nights in a week. There could be a drop in your appetite too. You might be suffering from a terrible headache which does not seem to go away. All of this, collectively, could have affected your ability to understand and perform tasks. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:06','2021-07-02 08:35:06',3),(264,34.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',104,102,'You could be having a hard time paying heed to the responsibilities at work and home. Your sleeping and eating pattern might have been significantly affected. There is a possibility that you aren’t able to attend your work.Your colleagues and head of the team might be noticing change in your performance and may have shared with you the same which could be hampering your confidence. You might be feeling demotivated to do even the things you are passionate about. Your close friends or a family member might have also mentioned about your growing tendency of indecisiveness and lack in patience. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:06','2021-07-02 08:35:06',4),(265,251.00,270.00,'Extremely Happy',105,103,'<p>You appear to be a happy and positive person. You seem to be an inspiration to others. It appears that you live in the present instead of dwelling in the past or future. You seem to have faith in your abilities and do not spend time worrying if you are good enough or not. Doubts and apprehensions do not seem to weigh you down. It appears that you also like to spend quality time with your friends and family. You seem to be adaptable and not worry much about life’s unpredictability. Optimism appears to be one of your greatest virtues. You tend to look at the positives instead of searching for faults.</p>','straight',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-04 16:46:56',1),(266,221.00,250.00,'Happy',105,103,'<p>You seem to be a happy soul. It appears that you spread happiness and others like to be around you. You seem to be an optimistic person who focuses on the positive aspects of life. Apprehensions and doubts do not seem to affect you. You appear to be living in the present instead of dwelling in past or future.</p>','straight',7,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-04 16:47:00',2),(267,171.00,220.00,'Moderately Happy',105,103,'<p>You seem to be a happy person but sometimes you might get affected by a few things in your environment. For instance, if someone criticizes you regarding your work, you might feel low for some time. You tend to stand right up instead of lamenting over something that didn’t go your way. It seems that you try to keep your spirits up by making changes in your lifestyle.</p>','straight',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-04 16:47:01',2),(268,0.00,170.00,'Unhappy',105,103,'<p>Your happiness might be getting affected by your environment. It seems that you 