some key tasks or saving yourself from getting hurt \r\nThe sense of protection might even extend to your interpersonal relationships, where it turns in self protection. Hence, you might be a little vigilant in your relationships. In a situation, when someone is nice to you, you seem to make sure if their intention is in the right place and they are not trying to take advantage of you.The sense of self-protection might be rooting for your survival instinct but it might hinder your ability to develop new relationships.\r\n  \r\nYou seem to be sentimental at times . In an unfavourable situation, you might get a little anxious. At times, it can affect your daily activities so manage this part of your personality well.\r\nIt appears that you have high self-esteem. This makes you a confident person and people look upto you for who you are, however it might be a little difficult for you to deal with refusals or criticism.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',NULL),(274,36.00,40.00,'Very High',108,106,'Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Very high self-esteem indicates that you are confident about your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviours.\r\n\r\nYou seem to have an adequate level of self-worth and a positive approach towards yourself. Strong principles and values seem to be your guiding force. Some of these values could be honest, trust, integrity, etc. You seem to have an inner drive to succeed. You tend to focus on your strengths and seem to be confident about your skills.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',1),(275,31.00,35.00,'High',108,106,'<p>Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Your high self-esteem indicates that you seem to see yourself in a positive light. You appear to be confident in your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviour. You seem to be adaptable and open to new challenges and changes. It is your self-worth and confidence that helps you to eradicate any apprehensions or adversities.</p>','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',5),(276,26.00,30.00,'Average',108,106,'You seem to be a confident person who tries to have a positive outlook on life but sometimes self doubt is emerging. There could be a sense of self-worth and self-appreciation. You seem to be guided by a set of strong principles and values. Your perception of yourself appears to be clear and positive. It seems to help you sail through the tough times. In recent times, you might be getting anxious and doubtful in a stressful situation. However, it does not seem to affect your self-esteem but you need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',2),(277,16.00,25.00,'Low',108,106,'Things might not be looking great in the office or at home due to possible lack of in your confidence level and feeling inferior to others. Regardless of the skills or talent you carry, you might doubt yourself and fear the judgment of others. There could be a lot of confusion and it might seem like you are experiencing some sort of a crisis. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',3),(278,10.00,15.00,'Very Low',108,106,'A very low self-esteem indicates that you might be having some sort of trouble in establishing your identity. This might lead to inferiority complex and negative self-worth and self-evaluations. You might be finding it tough to strive for the best. You can feel that you are not enough. This might cause some trouble in your personal and professional life. Your friends or someone from your family might have mentioned that you are too rigid and that makes it difficult to deal with you. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',4),(279,0.00,14.00,'Normal',109,107,'You seem to nurture confidence and peace in your day to day life. Challenges in personal and occupational life seem to motivate you to achieve your goals. You seem to be committed to a higher purpose in life, which helps you in becoming a better person each day. You seem to be able to handle difficult situations in life with vigour and a tranquil mind.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',1),(280,15.00,24.00,'Has State Anxiety',109,107,'However, sometimes, unpleasant situations at work or home might get overwhelming. It might affect your mood, sleep pattern, attention and concentration. These feelings are usually not permanent and might appear only when you face a difficult situation. The discomfort might subside when the current challenge is alleviated. Besides, you seem to be a calm and composed person. It appears that you stay relaxed in day to day life and have the ability to handle difficult emotions.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:07','2021-07-02 08:35:07',NULL),(281,0.00,14.00,'Normal',110,108,'You seem to be able to handle stressful situations aptly, without getting anxious. You appear to be confident and have a positive attitude in your day to day life. Challenges at home or work seem to not affect you adversely. You seem to have a healthy sleep schedule and can sleep peacefully without any tension. Even if you face difficult or stressful situations, it appears that you deal with them calmly instead of panicking. You seem to not dwell in arguments and try to focus on the solution rather than thinking about the problem. You seem to have a good work-life balance.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-02 08:35:08','2021-07-02 08:35:08',1),(282,15.00,24.00,'Has Trait Anxiety',110,108,'You seem to seek security and safety in your life. Hence, looking out for threats could be a frequent exercise. \