ior. Feeling of agitation and irritation is understandable in such a situation. You might have a perception of having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t actually present.  You need to take the situation seriously and look out for some help.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',3),(306,28.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',124,122,'You might be experiencing sadness and distress mostly throughout the day. Socializing might be a little difficult these days. Things that made you happy might be unable to give you a sense of satisfaction or contentment. You might be having troubles in continuing your routine work and personal activities. You might not be waking up fresh and excited to start the new day. There could be feelings of tiredness, lethargy, sleeplessness, etc. Sometimes, you might even experience body aches. Things might not be looking great at your workplace as well. You might not be interested in your work, hence, increasing numbers of absent days. Your difficult feelings and behaviour might be concerning to your friends or family. Feelings of agitation and irritation are natural in such a situation. You could perceive having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t present.You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',4),(307,0.00,14.00,'Normal',125,123,'Stress affects us all differently, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You tend to stay excited about life in general and have a positive attitude towards various challenges. Your closed ones seem be proud of you since you might understand your responsibilities and try to stand by your values. It appears that you are confident about your skills and capability, hence, you would be performing well at your workplace. It seems that you do not tend to dwell in arguments and quarrels and try to handle difficult situations calmly. You seem to be taking work pressure lightly. If there is loads of work and tight deadlines, it appears that you plan it well and then execute to finish work on time. You seem to maintain balance in your personal and professional life. Your physiological state appears to be in a good shape as well. \r\n','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',1),(308,15.00,18.00,'Mild',125,123,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You appear be an active person who manages house chores and daily work efficiently. Your sleep quality seems to be satisfactory. You seem to be waking up fresh most of the days. Of late, you might get a headache due to stress at home or work. You seem to be diligent, thorough and extremely attentive to the details, hence, your ability to make quick decisions might be affected. You seem to perform very well in a team and do not get apprehensive about your performance.Seldom,stress might get to you and you might end up feeling drained.\r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',2),(309,19.00,25.00,'Moderate',125,123,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives. You seem to be an optimistic person in general, who strives towards his/her goals and is hopeful about the future. You seem to perform well at work and might need to stick to a strict schedule. Being competitive could be one of your virtues as it seems to help you in achieving more. This behavior is slowly catching up with you.\r\nSometimes you might get overwhelmed with work and try to do everything at once. From time to time you might also suffer from sleepless nights, which might lead to a headache. Your friends or one of your family members might have casually asked you to take it lightly and relax. Since it seems that you have high expectations from yourself, you can feel discouraged if you are unable to achieve your goals. Sometimes, you might even take a lot of pressure on yourself and end up losing your appetite. You need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',2),(310,26.00,33.00,'Severe',125,123,'You must be wondering why you are feeling worn out constantly. Your efficiency to perform tasks at work and daily chores might have also reduced significantly. You might be getting agitated and frustrated because of this. One of your friends or a family member must have shown concern towards your behaviour. It is a possibility that because of this constant sense of worry you are unable to sleep most of the nights in a week. There could be a drop in your appetite too. You might be suffering from a terrible headache which does not seem to go away. All of this, collectively, could have affected your ability to understand and perform tasks. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',3),(311,34.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',125,123,'You could be having a hard time paying heed to the responsibilities at work and home. Your sleeping and eating pattern might have been significantly affected. There is a possibility that you aren’t able to attend your work.Your colleagues and head of the team might be noticing change in your performance and may have shared with you the same which could be hampering your confidence. You might be feeling demotivated to do even the things you are passionate about. Your close friends or a family member might have also mentioned about your growing tendency of indecisiveness and lack in patience. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:25','2021-07-03 08:23:25',4),(312,6.00,7.00,'Normal',126,124,'Balancing personal and professional life can be tough at times but it seems that you are able to deal with it adequately. Sometimes you can feel a little overwhelmed, it’s natural. However, it appears that you do not  get discouraged to pursue your goals. Your skill-set seems to be as per the job requirement. Hence, you appear to enjoy working without getting exhausted. Your work-life balance seems to be satisfactory and you are able to enjoy time with friends & family and engaging in group activities. The pressure at work seems to not affect you adversely. It appears to work as a catalyst for enhancing your performance. It seems that you are able to organize the work at office efficiently and complete the tasks in the given time. \r\n','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',1),(313,8.00,13.00,'Mild',126,124,'It seems that you are performing well at work. Your skills and aptitude appear to be as per the requirement of the job. The pressure at work seems to motivate you to be more efficient. You seem to set high standards for yourself. Of late, you might feel discouraged if you are unable to stand on your expectations. You tend to manage your work-life balance well. You seem to be satisfied with your personal life as well.\r\n\r\nJob burnout is a kind of work-related stress. It might affect you once in a blue moon, but mostly, you seem to be able to handle it with optimism.\r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',2),(314,14.00,20.00,'Moderate',126,124,'Balancing personal and professional life can be tough at times and though it seems that you are efficient and a great team player in your office but slowly the balance is tilting. Your experience, skills and aptitude seems to suit the job role. It appears that you set high standards for yourself, which helps you to be productive but, you might feel exhausted and disheartened if you are unable to achieve your goals. Mostly, you seem to be an optimistic person but occasionally you might get under pressure. It might cause some stress which can lead to sleep disturbance.\r\n \r\nJob burnout is distress related to work. Usually, you can manage it appropriately but sometimes it is getting over you. On those days, you might lack the motivation to start the work and the level of concentration and attention might also dip. You need to be observant about it.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',2),(315,21.00,24.00,'Severe',126,124,'Professional life is getting too demanding for you, at times. It is also possible that you might be giving it all to please your colleagues and managers. You might be working harder than needed because of the high workload or to fulfill expectations set against you. It might be leading to an imbalance in your personal and professional life. You might have very little or no time for yourself and this may cause exhaustion soon. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',3),(316,25.00,30.00,'Extremely Severe',126,124,'Professional life is getting too demanding for you. It is also possible that you are giving it your all to please the colleagues and managers. You might be working overtime because of the high workload or to fulfill high expectations set against you. It might lead to an imbalance in your personal and professional life. This can cause exhaustion as you might be having very little or no time for yourself. It is also possible that it is leading to poor performance and creating a spiral. It might also affect your emotional and mental health. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',4),(317,281.00,300.00,'Extremely Happy',127,125,'You appear to be a happy and positive person. You seem to be an inspiration to others. It appears that you live in the present instead of dwelling in the past or future. You seem to have faith in your abilities and do not spend time worrying if you are good enough or not. Doubts and apprehensions do not seem to weigh you down. It appears that you also like to spend quality time with your friends and family. You seem to be adaptable and not worry much about life’s unpredictability. Optimism appears to be one of your greatest virtues. You tend to look at the positives instead of searching for faults.\r\n','straight',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',1),(318,251.00,280.00,'Happy',127,125,'You seem to be a happy soul. It appears that you spread happiness and others like to be around you. You seem to be an optimistic person who focuses on the positive aspects of life. Apprehensions and doubts do not seem to affect you. You appear to be living in the present instead of dwelling in past or future.\r\n','straight',7,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',2),(319,200.00,250.00,'Moderately Happy',127,125,'You seem to be a happy person but sometimes you might get affected by a few things in your environment. For instance, if someone criticizes you regarding your work, you might feel low for some time. You tend to stand right up instead of lamenting over something that didn’t go your way. It seems that you try to keep your spirits up by making changes in your lifestyle.\r\n','straight',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',2),(320,0.00,199.00,'Unhappy',127,125,'Your happiness might be getting affected by your environment. It seems that you give priority to others first instead of yourself. You might be trying to please people around you so that they have a good perception of you. That might need you to go an extra mile and sometimes out of your comfort zone. You might get discouraged if you hear a negative perception of yourself. There is a tendency to dwell in past or future instead of living in the moment. You might also get affected by apprehensions and self-doubt.\r\n','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',4),(321,0.00,0.00,'',128,126,'You seem to be a considerate and thoughtful person who tends to give a lot of love and attention to people around. You might be expecting the same treatment in return. However, it might not be possible for everyone to be available for you all the time. Sometimes, it might hurt and you tend to start keeping a distance from such people. You have a great eye for details and tasks which needs vigliance can be assigned to you confidently. Infact you can take up some serious and mundane tasks with lot of ease and relieve others from pain of micro management, when you are around.  These traits in you can make some people perceive that it is hard to communicate with you. However, you might be protecting some key tasks or saving yourself from getting hurt \r\nThe sense of protection might even extend to your interpersonal relationships, where it turns in self protection. Hence, you might be a little vigilant in your relationships. In a situation, when someone is nice to you, you seem to make sure if their intention is in the right place and they are not trying to take advantage of you.The sense of self-protection might be rooting for your survival instinct but it might hinder your ability to develop new relationships.\r\n  \r\nYou seem to be sentimental at times . In an unfavourable situation, you might get a little anxious. At times, it can affect your daily activities so manage this part of your personality well.\r\nIt appears that you have high self-esteem. This makes you a confident person and people look upto you for who you are, however it might be a little difficult for you to deal with refusals or criticism.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:26','2021-07-03 08:23:26',NULL),(322,0.00,14.00,'Normal',129,127,'You seem to nurture confidence and peace in your day to day life. Challenges in personal and occupational life seem to motivate you to achieve your goals. You seem to be committed to a higher purpose in life, which helps you in becoming a better person each day. You seem to be able to handle difficult situations in life with vigour and a tranquil mind.','inverse',NUL