ionships. Your family members might want to talk to you. However, you might be unable to reciprocate with the same intensity of emotions. \r\nYou seem to be a responsible person who seeks security in all the spheres of life. If you learn to remain somewhat relaxed in many spheres of life then your qualities can take you to places.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:27','2021-07-03 08:23:27',NULL),(335,0.00,0.00,'',138,136,'You seem to have a friendly and welcoming personality. It appears that you seek advice from your friends and family before taking any important decision in your life. Your considertae behavior is liked by others and also makes you popular. You seem to be obedient and might not question authority. It appears that you like to go with the flow. \r\nYou seem to be kind and helpful. It might be difficult for you to say no to your closed ones.\r\nYou seem to be very attached to your friends and family and sometimes, might even fear of losing them. It might seem to you like you will be left alone. You might not be comfortable with that thought. Being in team gives you confidence and boosts your productivity. If left alone you might find it difficult to work.\r\n\r\nSome people might even perceive you as an under-confident person because you seek reassurance. So you must develop your independent side and work upon taking decisions and standing by them. You must try to lead in situations and bring some outcomes with your team player abilities.','straight',NULL,0,0,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:27','2021-07-03 08:23:27',NULL),(336,0.00,2.00,'Absent',139,137,'<p>Your job can be very demanding, in terms of time and effort. It could be affecting your relationship with your partner. You might not be feeling content in the relationship as both of you might have grown distant. There could be a lack of understanding too. Hence, you might not even put effort into making it work. The need of the hour is to understand each other\'s contribution to the relationship. You need to believe that you can bring back the lost charm, and can affect and influence each other. It can have a positive impact on your life and your partner\'s. The idea is to understand the importance of work-life balance. It can be difficult but it is important. If you wish, you can also use various emotional wellness techniques and tools to help you through this.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:27','2021-07-03 08:23:27',4),(337,3.00,7.00,'Present',139,137,'<p>Despite a demanding job, it seems that you can balance your professional and personal life well. Your relationship with your partner seems to be good. You both seem to understand and support each other in various situations. All your needs, whether physical or emotional, are fulfilled by your partner. You seem to be happy and content with your relationship. Making a relationship work needs a continuous effort. You seem to know it and understand its importance. You have a healthy relationship and are able to communicate if there are any misunderstandings or differences in opinions.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:27','2021-07-04 17:04:57',1),(338,0.00,2.00,'Absent',140,138,'<p>Financial security seems to be important when you are running a business. However, you must remember that ups and downs are a part of life. Lately, you might have been feeling financial pressure. It is okay to feel insecure in such a situation. Nonetheless, do not let it impact your daily routine. You should focus on your goals and coping strategies. You might be having sleepless nights or moments when you feel like losing it all. But hang in there. Look for your silver lining and keep working on it. Do not avoid meeting your friends or relatives. You might get some inspiration for them. You can also consider following emotional wellbeing techniques or using tools to help you sail through these tough times.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:27','2021-07-03 08:23:27',4),(339,3.00,7.00,'Present',140,138,'<p>You seem to be financially secure and have adequate money to meet your needs. It appears that you are in control of your finances and related decisions. You seem to have the financial freedom that allows you to make choices for living a contented and happy life. Financial security is important as it helps you to move confidently in society. You seem to be willing to provide financial help to the ones in need. It appears that you follow a budget or keep a tab on your spendings. It looks like that you don\'t tend to compare your income with someone else\'s or stress about it. You seem to focus on yourself and your financial growth.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:23:27','2021-07-04 17:05:11',1),(340,42.00,50.00,'Very High',142,140,'Job satisfaction refers to the feeling of fulfilment or enjoyment you might drive from your job. It seems that you are very satisfied with your job. Your job role appears to be suiting your skill-set and area of interest. You seem to have a great relationship with your employer as well. It appears that you have a good work-life balance. When you are able to achieve goals or objectives, you seem to be proud and satisfied. It appears that you value your job highly. ','straight',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:42:24','2021-07-03 08:42:24',1),(341,39.00,41.00,'High',142,140,'Job satisfaction refers to the feeling of fulfilment or enjoyment you might drive from your job. You seem to be satisfied with your company and conform to their values. It appears that you have a good relationship with your employer. Your job role seems to suit your skill-set and passion. You seem to be always talking highly about your workplace. Since you seem to be satisfied with your job, it acts as a motivator to work hard and achieve the goals. It appears that you value your job highly.','straight',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:42:24','2021-07-03 08:42:24',2),(342,32.00,38.00,'Average',142,140,'Job satisfaction refers to the feeling of fulfilment or e