 principles and values seem to be your guiding force. Some of these values could be honest, trust, integrity, etc. You seem to have an inner drive to succeed. You tend to focus on your strengths and seem to be confident about your skills.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:56:05','2021-07-03 08:56:05',1),(346,31.00,35.00,'High',143,141,'<p>Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Your high self-esteem indicates that you seem to see yourself in a positive light. You appear to be confident in your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviour. You seem to be adaptable and open to new challenges and changes. It is your self-worth and confidence that helps you to eradicate any apprehensions or adversities.</p>','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:56:05','2021-07-03 08:56:05',5),(347,26.00,30.00,'Average',143,141,'You seem to be a confident person who tries to have a positive outlook on life but sometimes self doubt is emerging. There could be a sense of self-worth and self-appreciation. You seem to be guided by a set of strong principles and values. Your perception of yourself appears to be clear and positive. It seems to help you sail through the tough times. In recent times, you might be getting anxious and doubtful in a stressful situation. However, it does not seem to affect your self-esteem but you need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08:56:05','2021-07-03 08:56:05',2),(348,16.00,25.00,'Low',143,141,'Things might not be looking great in the office or at home due to possible lack of in your confidence level and feeling inferior to others. Regardless of the skills or talent you carry, you might doubt yourself and fear the judgment of others. There could be a lot of confusion and it might seem like you are experiencing some sort of a crisis. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-03 08