it. You can also take regular screenings to know about your mental wellbeing. It is exactly like a full body checkup which you regularly do, this one is for your mental wellbeing which affects your overall wellbeing.&nbsp;</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:46:42','2021-07-04 23:46:42',1),(358,6.00,15.00,'Present',155,154,'<p>You seem to be cautious and think a lot about the future. It might be hampering your day to day activities and creating unnecessary stress. Lately, you might have been worrying excessively and often think about what time has in store for you. You might be thinking about various prospective situations and all the possible outcomes. Sometimes you might not feel like doing any routine activity. On the contrary, you might be too engrossed in your daily routine. You might even avoid social situations from time to time. You seem to be vigilant about safety. It might lead to an increased heart rate. Your sleep might have been getting disturbed due to the whole situation. The low mood might also accompany the other things mentioned above. But you need to understand that life is unpredictable and a lot of times we have to act as it comes. However, that unpredictability can be bothersome and lead to unnecessary worry. You might like to follow psychological techniques or use tools for enhancing your overall wellbeing.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:48:29','2021-07-04 23:48:29',4),(359,0.00,0.00,'Absent',156,155,'<p>You seem to be living your life to the fullest and are grateful for your time on earth. Sometimes, you might worry, what if one day you are gone, however, that thought seems to vanish away soon. It appears that you have a good understanding of the uncertainty and realize that life is unpredictable. Rather than worrying about the consequences, you seem to focus on the solutions and the positive side of things. It looks like you have a robust support system. It means that you seem to be surrounded by people who care for you.&nbsp;<br>The thought of death might cross your mind. Nonetheless, it does not seem to have a significant effect on your emotional self. It does not hamper your daily routine or interaction with others. You seem to have a clear mind regarding this which helps you live your life without any conditions.&nbsp;</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:50:04','2021-07-04 23:52:05',1),(360,1.00,5.00,'Present',156,155,'<p>You seem to like things in a planned manner including your work, daily routine, life, etc. The fear of the unknown might make you uncomfortable. One of your biggest fears is probably the fear of death. You might think and worry about it often. It appears that you find it hard to talk to someone about it. You might be lacking friends or family members who understand you and can help you sail through it. Your worries about death might get triggered by TV, news or information about someone\'s hospitalization or illness.&nbsp;<br>You might want to work on accepting death as the natural course of life. Try talking to someone about your worries or apprehensions. It might help you feel better. You can also consider emotional wellness techniques and tools for the betterment of your mental wellbeing.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:50:48','2021-07-04 23:50:48',4),(361,0.00,2.00,'Absent',157,156,'<p>You seem to be busy with your present daily routine that you might not be getting enough time for taking care of yourself. However, you might want to take care of your emotional and physical body for overall well-being. Lately, you might have noticed that the level of contentment or happiness is gradually declining. It indicates that your emotional health might be getting compromised. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; You can talk to someone; it can be a family member or a friend, and tell them how you feel. It might help you to manage your emotional well-being. Hence, support you in enhancing your overall well-being. If you feel that the situation is not getting better, you should consider taking the help of chat discussions or &nbsp;psychological wellness techniques and tools.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:54:16','2021-07-04 23:54:16',4),(362,3.00,5.00,'Present',157,156,'<p>You seem to be a happy and contented person. It looks like you are the source of your happiness. You do not seem to depend on external factors for your emotional well-being. It also appears that you can deal with daily life challenges with positivity and vigor. You seem to bounce back from setbacks and do not linger on negativity. People like being around you.<br>It seems that you know how to take control of your emotions and thoughts. It looks like that you have a sense of overall well-being i.e. you seem to take care of your psychological and physiological health. You seem to thrive on self-motivation and self-love.&nbsp;</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:55:08','2021-07-04 23:55:15',1),(363,0.00,2.00,'Low',158,157,'<p>Humans are social animals and most do well in a group of like-minded people. It is also crucial for our development. Social connections are essential and can help us when we seek advice, love, comfort, etc. Lately, you might feel like you are losing the bond with your family and friends. It might lead to a sense of detachment. It appears that you are unable to communicate or vent out your emotions. You might want to start communicating what you feel. It will also build a path of clear communication and will not leave any room for miscommunication or misunderstandings. If your family member or a friend initiates a conversation, you can try to take it further. It might help your emotional well-being as well.&nbsp;<br>If it feels like you are struggling, you can consider taking the help of &nbsp;chat discussions or emotional wellness techniques and tools.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:56:55','2021-07-04 23:56:55',4),(364,3.00,6.00,'High',158,157,'<p>Humans are social animals and most do well in a group of like-minded people. It is also crucial for our development. Social connections are essential and can help us when we seek advice, love, comfort, etc. You seem to be a friendly person who has good social connections. It also indicates that you have a solid support system of people who might help you in your time of need. Strangers seem to perceive you as approachable and easy to talk to. It might be helping you in building new connections. You seem to be enjoying good emotional well-being as well.&nbsp;</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-04 23:57:56','2021-07-04 23:57:56',1),(365,0.00,1.00,'Absent',159,158,'<p>Loneliness is a normal emotional response to the absence of friends or family. However, it should not disrupt your emotional well-being. You seem to understand this. Hence, managing your emotions well. It appears that you have a strong support system of people who are there for you when you need them. It can be your family members, children or friends. It seems that you appreciate your relationships and work on the bond. You seem to communicate clearly and make sure that there is no space for misunderstandings. It looks like you have a good social circle, who like and support you. Even if you feel lonely at times, you can manage it well and do not let it hamper your daily routine.&nbsp;</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-05 00:02:25','2021-07-05 00:02:25',1),(366,2.00,5.00,'Present',159,158,'<p>You might be feeling lonely and it is okay to feel so if it is not hampering your daily routine. However, it appears that you might be struggling. Your children might be living somewhere else due to study or work. It might be adding to your issues. You might want to try talking to them about how you feel. Communication is the key to healthy relationships. Your friends might be away too or there could be a lack of communication and efforts in maintaining the relationship. It might shrink your social life too. &nbsp;In such situations you must ensure the maintain communication with some or the other company around you. You can even consider using chat discussions, emotional wellness tools and techniques to help you in this situation.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-05 00:04:51','2021-07-05 09:33:29',4),(367,0.00,7.00,'Normal',167,166,'<p>You appear to be a positive person who is not much affected by negative thoughts and apprehensions. The level of your concentration and attention seems to be good and hence, the tendency to make small mistakes turns out to be low. It seems that you are peaceful and balanced most of the time and take decisions after thinking through. Your sleep quality is probably good and the propensity to get agitated or irritated seems to be insignificant. It appears that you like to plan for your future instead of worrying about your troubles. Your performance at work seems to be good and you appear to be satisfied with your work-life. Personal and social life seems to be wonderful and you probably are an inspiration to the people around you.</p>','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',1),(368,8.00,9.00,'Mild',167,166,'<p>You seem to be a calm and happy person in general but of late worries might be affecting you. You seem to have developed some negativity and apprehensions, hence, the tendency to get agitated or irritated appears sometimes. Propensity to plan about the future for mitigating any risks seems to be prevalent. This might keep you up on some nights. Once in a while, you might feel that your concentration and attention is getting affected due to stress at work or home. When you are engaged in work, you seem to be an efficient member of the team, however, sometimes you may lose the track and end up thinking about your future a bit too much.</p>','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',5),(369,10.00,14.00,'Moderate',167,166,'You seem to be a calm and happy person in general but of late worries might be affecting you. You seem to have developed some negativity and apprehensions, hence, the tendency to get agitated or irritated appears sometimes. Propensity to plan about the future for mitigating any risks seems to be prevalent. This might keep you up on some nights. Once in a while, you might feel that your concentration and attention is getting affected due to stress at work or home. When you are engaged in work, you seem to be an efficient member of the team, however, sometimes you may lose the track and end up thinking about your future a bit too much.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',2),(370,15.00,19.00,'Severe',167,166,'Things at work or home might not be going as per your way. It could be an overwhelming feeling. You might feel uneasy and there could be a constant sense of worry. You might also experience breathlessness, rapid heartbeat, palpitations, sweating, trembling, etc. Your performance might get affected because of the burden of unreasonable worries. Your concentration and attention level could also be getting affected. You might feel on the edge and even small issues could be affecting you deeply. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',3),(371,20.00,42.00,'Extremely Severe',167,166,'You might be feeling extremely uneasy and there could be a tendency to ignore personal and professional responsibilities. Tasks which seemed easy earlier might be getting difficult to complete. Your heartbeat and breath could be abnormal most of the times because of constant worries. Your irritation or agitation to even a trivial stimulus could be magnified. Your ability to think and understand might have gotten affected significantly. You might be having sleepless nights. Due to so many changes, there is a presumption that you might be feeling incapable of continuing work or even taking up meager responsibilities.You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',4),(372,0.00,9.00,'Normal',168,167,'You seem to have an ability to understand and balance your emotions, understand what is causing problems and manage yourself proactively and reactively. It seems that you are an emotionally strong person and do not allow ups and downs of life to impact your mental wellbeing. Your quality to keep personal, social and professional life in harmony seems to be remarkable. Your reaction to something is usually as per the intensity of the situation. You seem to like being around people and a part of a social circle. At work, you seem to be energetic and full of motivation. It seems that you are satisfied with your performance while striving to achieve more. Mood swings might not affect you often and usually, you are in a balanced state of mind','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',1),(373,10.00,13.00,'Mild',168,167,'You seem to be an energetic and easy-going person who might like to be a part of group activities and interacting with new people. It seems that you are able to understand your emotions and thoughts and dissect them to know what is causing what? You are probably capable of managing your work-life balance well. \r\nOf late, you may notice a shift in your energy levels and excitement for things that make you happy. Once in a while, you might not want to be part of social gatherings because you are not excited about it. You might experience mood swings rarely but it might affect your performance on such days. \r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',2),(374,14.00,20.00,'Moderate',168,167,'You seem to be an easy-going person who likes to be a part of group activities and interacting with new people. It seems that you understand your emotions and thoughts and dissect them to know what is causing what. You probably are capable to manage your work-life balance well but sometimes, you might face problems in your personal, professional and social life. At work, you could be performing well and completing tasks but there can be times when you end up making small mistakes. Focusing on things might be getting a little difficult when you are surrounded by a lot of work or thoughts. You probably feel fatigued a little more than often and sometimes there could be some body aches too. You need to be observant of the situation.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',2),(375,21.00,27.00,'Severe',168,167,'You might be unable to find happiness in the things that excited you in past. Social gatherings may not be as exciting and you might be feeling distant from your friends and family. There could be lack in energy and you might feel like resting or sleeping throughout the day. Your job might not interest you anymore. There could be increased sensitivity towards trivial matters.  Your loved ones might have talked to you about this shift in your behavior. Feeling of agitation and irritation is understandable in such a situation. You might have a perception of having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t actually present.  You need to take the situation seriously and look out for some help.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',3),(376,28.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',168,167,'You might be experiencing sadness and distress mostly throughout the day. Socializing might be a little difficult these days. Things that made you happy might be unable to give you a sense of satisfaction or contentment. You might be having troubles in continuing your routine work and personal activities. You might not be waking up fresh and excited to start the new day. There could be feelings of tiredness, lethargy, sleeplessness, etc. Sometimes, you might even experience body aches. Things might not be looking great at your workplace as well. You might not be interested in your work, hence, increasing numbers of absent days. Your difficult feelings and behaviour might be concerning to your friends or family. Feelings of agitation and irritation are natural in such a situation. You could perceive having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t present.You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',4),(377,0.00,14.00,'Normal',169,168,'Stress affects us all differently, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You tend to stay excited about life in general and have a positive attitude towards various challenges. Your closed ones seem be proud of you since you might understand your responsibilities and try to stand by your values. It appears that you are confident about your skills and capability, hence, you would be performing well at your workplace. It seems that you do not tend to dwell in arguments and quarrels and try to handle difficult situations calmly. You seem to be taking work pressure lightly. If there is loads of work and tight deadlines, it appears that you plan it well and then execute to finish work on time. You seem to maintain balance in your personal and professional life. Your physiological state appears to be in a good shape as well. \r\n','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',1),(378,15.00,18.00,'Mild',169,168,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives, however, you seem to have the ability to handle it well. You appear be an active person who manages house chores and daily work efficiently. Your sleep quality seems to be satisfactory. You seem to be waking up fresh most of the days. Of late, you might get a headache due to stress at home or work. You seem to be diligent, thorough and extremely attentive to the details, hence, your ability to make quick decisions might be affected. You seem to perform very well in a team and do not get apprehensive about your performance.Seldom,stress might get to you and you might end up feeling drained.\r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',2),(379,19.00,25.00,'Moderate',169,168,'Stress affects all of us at some point in our lives. You seem to be an optimistic person in general, who strives towards his/her goals and is hopeful about the future. You seem to perform well at work and might need to stick to a strict schedule. Being competitive could be one of your virtues as it seems to help you in achieving more. This behavior is slowly catching up with you.\r\nSometimes you might get overwhelmed with work and try to do everything at once. From time to time you might also suffer from sleepless nights, which might lead to a headache. Your friends or one of your family members might have casually asked you to take it lightly and relax. Since it seems that you have high expectations from yourself, you can feel discouraged if you are unable to achieve your goals. Sometimes, you might even take a lot of pressure on yourself and end up losing your appetite. You need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',2),(380,26.00,32.00,'Severe',169,168,'<p>You must be wondering why you are feeling worn out constantly. Your efficiency to perform tasks at work and daily chores might have also reduced significantly. You might be getting agitated and frustrated because of this. One of your friends or a family member must have shown concern towards your behaviour. It is a possibility that because of this constant sense of worry you are unable to sleep most of the nights in a week. There could be a drop in your appetite too. You might be suffering from a terrible headache which does not seem to go away. All of this, collectively, could have affected your ability to understand and perform tasks. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.</p>','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',3),(381,33.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',169,168,'<p>You could be having a hard time paying heed to the responsibilities at work and home. Your sleeping and eating pattern might have been significantly affected. There is a possibility that you aren’t able to attend your work.Your colleagues and head of the team might be noticing change in your performance and may have shared with you the same which could be hampering your confidence. You might be feeling demotivated to do even the things you are passionate about. Your close friends or a family member might have also mentioned about your growing tendency of indecisiveness and lack in patience. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.</p>','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:14','2021-07-14 11:08:14',4),(382,0.00,11.00,'Normal',170,169,'You use the Internet adequately and do not allow it to hamper your daily life. You might be comfortable even when you don’t access your phone or social media regularly. The chances are that you use the Internet for knowledge and enhancing your performance. Even if your smartphone doesn’t have an internet connection, you seem to not get affected by it.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:15','2021-07-14 11:08:15',1),(383,12.00,17.00,'Mild',170,169,'<p>You seem to be aware of the pros and cons of using the internet. It appears that you usually utilize the internet for getting information. You seem to spend some time on social media as well. Of late, you might be using the internet more than usual. You might tend to indulge without realizing the limitations of your screen time. However, it seems that you can control your usage once you know that it’s affecting your day to day life and work performance.</p>','inverse',7,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:15','2021-07-14 11:08:15',5),(384,18.00,28.00,'Moderate',170,169,'You seem to be aware of the pros and cons of using the internet but loosing control on self, slowly. You might have also noticed that your internet consumption is increasing gradually. It seems that you must take some measures to restrict your usage. You appear to be quite active on social media. It might be your escape from your real life. It seems that you enjoy engaging and talking to people online.\r\nSometimes you might use the internet more than usual. There could have been an instance where one of your family members poked you regarding your internet indulgence. It might have irritated you. From time to time, you want to spend extra time on the internet. It can lead you to lose interest in your job & family. It might also affect your work performance.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:15','2021-07-14 11:08:15',2),(385,29.00,35.00,'Severe',170,169,'In an era where the internet is so easily accessible, it is easy to go with the flow. You might be using the internet more than usual and it might have started affecting your personal and professional life. You might not be interested in your education, career or job. It might be getting difficult for you to assess the consequences of overconsumption of the internet. Social media might be your escape from the real world. You might genuinely like engaging in online conversations instead of talking to people in real life. There could have been an instance where one of your family members poked you regarding your indulgence in social media and that might have irritated you. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:15','2021-07-14 11:08:15',4),(386,0.00,2.00,'Absent',171,170,'<p>Making a relationship work requires time and effort. It can be really difficult at times. Lately, you might have been experiencing difficulties in your relationship as well. Your expectations from your partner might not have been getting fulfilled. You may also find it difficult to talk to your partner. Both you and your partner need time and must understand each other\'s contribution to the relationship. You both have the power to influence and impact each other. You might be trying to fix the relationship but it is possible that you are not getting the expected response from your partner. You can try to give some time or a safe space to vent out the emotions. It can help to heal your relationship. You can also try various emotional wellness techniques to bring about a positive change.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:15','2021-07-14 11:08:15',4),(387,3.00,7.00,'Present',171,170,'<p>You seem to have a good relationship with your partner. You both tend to understand and be there for each other. Your emotional and physical needs are also fulfilled. It appears that you do not find it difficult to have conversations with your partner. Even in case of misunderstandings or differences of opinion, you are able to communicate. When the times get hard, you do not seem to lose hope and try to make it work despite all the hurdles. You and your partner seem to realise that having a good relationships needs time and effort. It gives both of you and your relationship a secure space to grow.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 11:08:15','2021-07-14 11:08:15',1),(388,0.00,2.00,'Absent',160,159,'<figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Distractions are all around us. Talk about constant mobile phone notifications, captivating web series, etc. However, you seem to be handling it well. Your level of concentration seems to be good which helps you focus on the task at hand. It doesn\'t seem like you have an urge to move constantly. Your performance seems to be good too.&nbsp;<br>If you can\'t focus sometimes, it doesn\'t seem to be related to attention and concentration issues. It could be due to something else. You might want to keep a check on your mental well-being with regular screenings and social exercises. It will help you to recognize any condition before it gets out of hand.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 12:51:08','2021-07-14 12:51:08',1),(389,3.00,10.00,'Present',160,159,'<p>We all are surrounded by a lot of distractions. Constant notifications from mobile phones, captivating television series, etc. keep us hooked. It is one of the leading causes of decreasing attention spans. Lately, you might have been noticing that your attention span is also getting affected. You might be experiencing difficulties in focusing or sticking to a task. It might have been affecting your performance too.&nbsp;<br>Sometimes, you might even find it hard to sit at a place and feel the need to move within a short span of time. It might be causing a hindrance to your daily routine.&nbsp;<br>If you feel that the situation is not getting better and you are not able to concentrate, then you must consider using professional chat discussions or psychological wellness tools and techniques.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 12:52:32','2021-07-14 12:55:50',4),(390,0.00,2.00,'Absent',161,160,'<p>Social support and emotional security are vital for our development. We depend on peer groups for emotional, social and psychological support. A peer group is, basically, a group of people having similar interests, age group, background or social status.&nbsp;<br>Sometimes, we try to fit in a group that is not right for us. You seem to understand this and do not engage with people who make you uncomfortable. You seem to know what is right and wrong for you.&nbsp;<br>It looks like you take a stand for yourself and your opinions when there is a need. There can be moments of weakness when you tend to go with the flow and succumb to peer pressure. However, you seem to be clear about your dos and don\'ts. You do not seem to compromise with your value system. You might want to continue maintaining it.&nbsp;</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 12:54:00','2021-07-14 12:54:00',1),(391,3.00,10.00,'Present',161,160,'<p>Being a part of a social group is a great feeling. It brings a sense of belongingness, emotional security and social support. A group of peers can motivate us to do well. On the other hand, it can also deviate us from our path. It depends on what kind of people we are involved with. Lately, you might have been spending a lot of time with your friends. You might have also been neglecting some important things like your studies, family, etc. It seems like you might be doing things out of your comfort zone just because your friends are doing it. It is indicating that you might not be taking a stand for yourself and your opinions.&nbsp;<br>However, it is crucial to know that you might not want to lose your identity. Instead, you can be with people who appreciate who you are.&nbsp;<br>If you feel that you aren\'t able to come out of it, you can consider using professional chat discussions or psychological tools and techniques for maintaining your overall well-being.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 12:55:03','2021-07-14 12:55:30',4),(392,0.00,2.00,'Absent',163,162,'<p>It seems that you realise that it is important to succeed in life. Sometimes, you might get under pressure but mostly you seem to manage it well. You seem to know when it is the right time to take a break. You can communicate well with your family and invest time in your hobbies or other areas of interest. Your family seems to be supportive of you and your decisions too.<br>Academic burnout happens when a person over-exerts himself/herself. One might feel emotionally and physically exhausted. There can be a lack of motivation and reduced ability in academics.<br>If you feel that there is some problem, you might not want to leave it unaddressed. Environmental factors should be taken into consideration. If you address it at the right time, you can protect your emotional well-being.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 12:57:38','2021-07-14 12:57:38',1),(393,3.00,15.00,'Present',163,162,'<p>There\'s a lot of focus on being the best and succeeding that we fail to realise its impact on our emotional well-being. You seem to be taking academics seriously. However, studying for long hours without enough breaks might not be working in your favour. You might not be giving enough time to yourself for recharging. You may want to take some time out for recreation. It can be as simple as taking time out for your friends or family or pursuing your hobbies.&nbsp;<br>Your parents might be putting pressure on you to perform well in academics. It might be stressing you out. Sometimes, you might even feel that you are not getting enough support from your family. There could be other issues that might be bothering you. It seems like you might have also started feeling mentally and physically exhausted. You can consider psychological tools or techniques to help you sail through it.</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 12:58:22','2021-07-14 12:58:22',4),(394,0.00,2.00,'Absent',164,163,'<p>The child seems to have self-control and can set his/her priorities efficiently. He/she knows his/her boundaries and focus on important things like their health, studies, friends, family, etc. Even if he/she plays video games, he/she won\'t find it difficult to pause it and do something else. It seems to help him/her to invest time in activities they like to pursue. It can be dancing, singing, painting, cooking, etc. You may want to continue inculcating healthy habits as it will help the child\'s development. It seems that the child likes to spend time outdoors playing with friends or enjoying nature. It will benefit their emotional and physical health.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:28:44','2021-07-14 15:28:44',1),(395,3.00,10.00,'Present',164,163,'<p>Playing games in moderation can benefit a person by enhancing his/her concentration, visual-spatial skills, problem-solving skills, etc. The habit turns problematic when the person is unable to stop playing games despite limits, deadline and warnings.<br>Lately, you might be noticing a strong inclination towards playing games. It might be significantly affecting your interpersonal relationships and academic life. If someone from your family asks you to stop playing games, you might get irritated and it might lead to an argument. It might be affecting relationships within the family.&nbsp;<br>You might be finding it hard to stick to a schedule and often spend more time on games than you should. You might want to try taking small steps towards the betterment. You can try spending time outdoors or taking part in sports activities. It won\'t only improve your physical health but also your emotional well-being.&nbsp;<br>You can also consider psychological wellness techniques and tools that are specially designed for controlling the urge to play games.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:29:20','2021-07-14 15:29:32',4),(396,0.00,2.00,'Absent',165,164,'<p>You seem to be a confident and positive person. It appears that you enjoy socializing and learn about different perspectives from people. Even in unfamiliar situations, you seem to communicate well without much hesitance. This quality is also good for your interpersonal relationships. &nbsp;<br>You seem to have leadership qualities and like taking up roles like class representative, captain, etc. You seem to look forward to networking events where you can meet new people.&nbsp;<br>You seem to communicate your needs and wants, which might reduce the chances of misinterpretation of your non-verbal cues.&nbsp;<br>It appears that you are comfortable in attempting oral tests and activities like public speaking.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:30:52','2021-07-14 15:30:52',1),(397,3.00,11.00,'Present',165,164,'<p>Social situations at times might be overwhelming regardless of where you are. You do seem to feel comfortable around your friends and family. However, it appears that you might be hesitant in talking to people or doing something in front of people like public speaking, attending weddings, presentation classes etc.&nbsp;<br>You might be having the skills to perform tasks well, however, your hesitancy affects your performance. You might get anxious if asked to do something in front of people. It seems that you might be avoiding such situations completely. You might be afraid of getting judged by others or embarrassing yourself.&nbsp;<br>The frequency of such behaviors might have increased. You might be experiencing some physiological discomfort as well. You can consider using psychological tools and techniques for the betterment of your mental well-being.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:31:37','2021-07-29 12:15:20',4),(398,0.00,1.00,'Absent',166,165,'<p>You seem to have a good body image. It means that you accept all your body\'s flaws and imperfections with pride. You do not seem to get affected by other\'s opinions on your body. You seem to accept the fact the everyone\'s unique and special. It also looks like you listen to your body and hunger cues and eat according to the need. You might want to keep following a healthy routine for the betterment of your overall well-being.&nbsp;<br>You can also have moments of weakness, where you compare your body with others but that thought does not seem to last long. You seem to be confident about your body and promote body positivity.</p>','straight',9,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:33:55','2021-07-14 15:34:19',1),(399,2.00,4.00,'Moderate',166,165,'<p>Our environment dictates how we perceive body image. A lot of times, inclusivity is missing. People are often pulled down because of the way they look. However, influencers and media have started addressing it by moving beyond filters and Photoshop. A body-positive environment is not too far.</p><p>Sometimes, you might be pressurizing yourself a bit too much regarding the shape and size of your body. Comments of others on your body might make you conscious and might be affecting you positively or negatively. Your perception of body image might also depend on how your family members react on this matter. A lot of time, we are pressurized by our family to be a certain way. You can try to not get affected by other people\'s opinion on your body. You only might want to make sure that you are happy with how you look. If you feel you are unable to do so, you can take the help of psychological tools and techniques.&nbsp;</p>','straight',5,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:35:22','2021-07-14 15:35:22',3),(400,5.00,7.00,'Severe',166,165,'<p>All of us struggle with body image during our lifetime. Some people can get over it, while others struggle to accept their body. It depends on your environment and how people around you understand body image. You might not be feeling good about your body. It might also be pulling you down in various other aspects of life.<br>It looks like you are concerned about the shape of your body and how it looks. You might even be cutting down on your dietary intake for losing weight. Your relationship with food might also be getting hampered. On some days, you might be eating way less and on other days, you might overeat to make yourself feel good. These are some issues that need to be addressed.&nbsp;<br>You might have to restore the love for your body. You can take the help of various psychological tools and techniques or consult an expert who can help you sail through it.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:35:54','2021-07-14 15:35:54',4),(401,36.00,40.00,'Very High',172,171,'Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Very high self-esteem indicates that you are confident about your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviours.\r\n\r\nYou seem to have an adequate level of self-worth and a positive approach towards yourself. Strong principles and values seem to be your guiding force. Some of these values could be honest, trust, integrity, etc. You seem to have an inner drive to succeed. You tend to focus on your strengths and seem to be confident about your skills.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:16','2021-07-14 15:58:16',1),(402,31.00,35.00,'High',172,171,'<p>Self-esteem refers to your sense of self-worth and personal value. In other words, it means how much you appreciate or like yourself. Your high self-esteem indicates that you seem to see yourself in a positive light. You appear to be confident in your appearance, beliefs, emotions and behaviour. You seem to be adaptable and open to new challenges and changes. It is your self-worth and confidence that helps you to eradicate any apprehensions or adversities.</p>','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:16','2021-07-14 15:58:16',5),(403,26.00,30.00,'Average',172,171,'You seem to be a confident person who tries to have a positive outlook on life but sometimes self doubt is emerging. There could be a sense of self-worth and self-appreciation. You seem to be guided by a set of strong principles and values. Your perception of yourself appears to be clear and positive. It seems to help you sail through the tough times. In recent times, you might be getting anxious and doubtful in a stressful situation. However, it does not seem to affect your self-esteem but you need to be observant of self.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:16','2021-07-14 15:58:16',2),(404,16.00,25.00,'Low',172,171,'Things might not be looking great in the office or at home due to possible lack of in your confidence level and feeling inferior to others. Regardless of the skills or talent you carry, you might doubt yourself and fear the judgment of others. There could be a lot of confusion and it might seem like you are experiencing some sort of a crisis. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:16','2021-07-14 15:58:16',3),(405,10.00,15.00,'Very Low',172,171,'A very low self-esteem indicates that you might be having some sort of trouble in establishing your identity. This might lead to