ironment and how people around you understand body image. You might not be feeling good about your body. It might also be pulling you down in various other aspects of life.<br>It looks like you are concerned about the shape of your body and how it looks. You might even be cutting down on your dietary intake for losing weight. Your relationship with food might also be getting hampered. On some days, you might be eating way less and on other days, you might overeat to make yourself feel good. These are some issues that need to be addressed.&nbsp;<br>You might have to restore the love for your body. You can take the help of various psychological tools and techniques or consult an expert who can help you sail through it.&nbsp;</p>','straight',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-15 16:53:10',4),(417,0.00,7.00,'Normal',178,177,'<p>You appear to be a positive person who is not much affected by negative thoughts and apprehensions. The level of your concentration and attention seems to be good and hence, the tendency to make small mistakes turns out to be low. It seems that you are peaceful and balanced most of the time and take decisions after thinking through. Your sleep quality is probably good and the propensity to get agitated or irritated seems to be insignificant. It appears that you like to plan for your future instead of worrying about your troubles. Your performance at work seems to be good and you appear to be satisfied with your work-life. Personal and social life seems to be wonderful and you probably are an inspiration to the people around you.</p>','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 23:28:47',1),(418,8.00,9.00,'Mild',178,177,'<p>You seem to be a calm and happy person in general but of late worries might be affecting you. You seem to have developed some negativity and apprehensions, hence, the tendency to get agitated or irritated appears sometimes. Propensity to plan about the future for mitigating any risks seems to be prevalent. Th