ings because you are not excited about it. You might experience mood swings rarely but it might affect your performance on such days. \r\n','inverse',8,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',2),(424,14.00,20.00,'Moderate',179,178,'You seem to be an easy-going person who likes to be a part of group activities and interacting with new people. It seems that you understand your emotions and thoughts and dissect them to know what is causing what. You probably are capable to manage your work-life balance well but sometimes, you might face problems in your personal, professional and social life. At work, you could be performing well and completing tasks but there can be times when you end up making small mistakes. Focusing on things might be getting a little difficult when you are surrounded by a lot of work or thoughts. You probably feel fatigued a little more than often and sometimes there could be some body aches too. You need to be observant of the situation.','inverse',6,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',2),(425,21.00,27.00,'Severe',179,178,'You might be unable to find happiness in the things that excited you in past. Social gatherings may not be as exciting and you might be feeling distant from your friends and family. There could be lack in energy and you might feel like resting or sleeping throughout the day. Your job might not interest you anymore. There could be increased sensitivity towards trivial matters.  Your loved ones might have talked to you about this shift in your behavior. Feeling of agitation and irritation is understandable in such a situation. You might have a perception of having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t actually present.  You need to take the situation seriously and look out for some help.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',3),(426,28.00,200.00,'Extremely Severe',179,178,'You might be experiencing sadness and distress mostly throughout the day. Socializing might be a little difficult these days. Things that made you happy might be unable to give you a sense of satisfaction or contentment. You might be having troubles in continuing your routine work and personal activities. You might not be waking up fresh and excited to start the new day. There could be feelings of tiredness, lethargy, sleeplessness, etc. Sometimes, you might even experience body aches. Things might not be looking great at your workplace as well. You might not be interested in your work, hence, increasing numbers of absent days. Your difficult feelings and behaviour might be concerning to your friends or family. Feelings of agitation and irritation are natural in such a situation. You could perceive having seen, heard, touched, tasted or smelled something that isn’t present.You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',4),(427,0.00,11.00,'Normal',180,179,'You use the Internet adequately and do not allow it to hamper your daily life. You might be comfortable even when you don’t access your phone or social media regularly. The chances are that you use the Internet for knowledge and enhancing your performance. Even if your smartphone doesn’t have an internet connection, you seem to not get affected by it.','inverse',10,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',1),(428,12.00,17.00,'Mild',180,179,'<p>You seem to be aware of the pros and cons of using the internet. It appears that you usually utilize the internet for getting information. You seem to spend some time on social media as well. Of late, you might be using the internet more than usual. You might tend to indulge without realizing the limitations of your screen time. However, it seems that you can control your usage once you know that it’s affecting your day to day life and work performance.</p>','inverse',7,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',5),(429,18.00,28.00,'Moderate',180,179,'You seem to be aware of the pros and cons of using the internet but loosing control on self, slowly. You might have also noticed that your internet consumption is increasing gradually. It seems that you must take some measures to restrict your usage. You appear to be quite active on social media. It might be your escape from your real life. It seems that you enjoy engaging and talking to people online.\r\nSometimes you might use the internet more than usual. There could have been an instance where one of your family members poked you regarding your internet indulgence. It might have irritated you. From time to time, you want to spend extra time on the internet. It can lead you to lose interest in your job & family. It might also affect your work performance.','inverse',4,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',2),(430,29.00,35.00,'Severe',180,179,'In an era where the internet is so easily accessible, it is easy to go with the flow. You might be using the internet more than usual and it might have started affecting your personal and professional life. You might not be interested in your education, career or job. It might be getting difficult for you to assess the consequences of overconsumption of the internet. Social media might be your escape from the real world. You might genuinely like engaging in online conversations instead of talking to people in real life. There could have been an instance where one of your family members poked you regarding your indulgence in social media and that might have irritated you. You need to take the situation seriously and find some help to overcome.','inverse',2,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 15:58:17','2021-07-14 15:58:17',4),(431,0.00,14.00,'Normal',181,180,'You seem to nurture confidence and peace in your day to day life. Challenges in personal and occupational life seem to motivate you to achieve your goals. You seem to be committed to a higher purpose in life, which helps you in becoming a better person each day. You seem to be able to handle difficult situations in life with vigour and a tranquil mind.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:00:03','2021-07-14 22:00:03',1),(432,15.00,24.00,'Has State Anxiety',181,180,'However, sometimes, unpleasant situations at work or home might get overwhelming. It might affect your mood, sleep pattern, attention and concentration. These feelings are usually not permanent and might appear only when you face a difficult situation. The discomfort might subside when the current challenge is alleviated. Besides, you seem to be a calm and composed person. It appears that you stay relaxed in day to day life and have the ability to handle difficult emotions.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:00:03','2021-07-14 22:00:03',NULL),(433,0.00,14.00,'Normal',182,181,'You seem to be able to handle stressful situations aptly, without getting anxious. You appear to be confident and have a positive attitude in your day to day life. Challenges at home or work seem to not affect you adversely. You seem to have a healthy sleep schedule and can sleep peacefully without any tension. Even if you face difficult or stressful situations, it appears that you deal with them calmly instead of panicking. You seem to not dwell in arguments and try to focus on the solution rather than thinking about the problem. You seem to have a good work-life balance.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:00:03','2021-07-14 22:00:03',1),(434,15.00,24.00,'Has Trait Anxiety',182,181,'You seem to seek security and safety in your life. Hence, looking out for threats could be a frequent exercise. \r\nIf you sense any disturbance, you might start getting anxious for the sake of your protection. Anxiety is a reflex action to help you survive. When you face an unpleasant situation, you might experience physiological changes like palpitations and sweaty hands. It might affect your performance and ability to deal with challenges.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:00:03','2021-07-14 22:00:03',NULL),(435,0.00,14.00,'Normal',183,182,'You seem to nurture confidence and peace in your day to day life. Challenges in personal and occupational life seem to motivate you to achieve your goals. You seem to be committed to a higher purpose in life, which helps you in becoming a better person each day. You seem to be able to handle difficult situations in life with vigour and a tranquil mind.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:03:57','2021-07-14 23:28:47',1),(436,15.00,24.00,'Has State Anxiety',183,182,'However, sometimes, unpleasant situations at work or home might get overwhelming. It might affect your mood, sleep pattern, attention and concentration. These feelings are usually not permanent and might appear only when you face a difficult situation. The discomfort might subside when the current challenge is alleviated. Besides, you seem to be a calm and composed person. It appears that you stay relaxed in day to day life and have the ability to handle difficult emotions.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:03:57','2021-07-14 23:28:47',NULL),(437,0.00,14.00,'Normal',184,183,'You seem to be able to handle stressful situations aptly, without getting anxious. You appear to be confident and have a positive attitude in your day to day life. Challenges at home or work seem to not affect you adversely. You seem to have a healthy sleep schedule and can sleep peacefully without any tension. Even if you face difficult or stressful situations, it appears that you deal with them calmly instead of panicking. You seem to not dwell in arguments and try to focus on the solution rather than thinking about the problem. You seem to have a good work-life balance.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:03:57','2021-07-14 23:28:47',1),(438,15.00,24.00,'Has Trait Anxiety',184,183,'You seem to seek security and safety in your life. Hence, looking out for threats could be a frequent exercise. \r\nIf you sense any disturbance, you might start getting anxious for the sake of your protection. Anxiety is a reflex action to help you survive. When you face an unpleasant situation, you might experience physiological changes like palpitations and sweaty hands. It might affect your performance and ability to deal with challenges.','inverse',NULL,1,1,NULL,'2021-07-14 22:03:57','2021-07-14 23:28:47',NULL);
